{"vid":"2gIaaPT_-Ag","source":"2gIaaPT_-Ag.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Should you watch this video? Of course."},{"t":3.8,"txt":"If only making all decisions were that"},{"t":5.6,"txt":"easy. Decision- making is a skill that"},{"t":7.8,"txt":"impacts nearly every aspect of work in"},{"t":10.4,"txt":"life. So much so that the average adult"},{"t":13.2,"txt":"makes around [music]"},{"t":14.3,"txt":"35,000 total decisions each day. With so"},{"t":17.8,"txt":"many choices on the line, it helps to"},{"t":19.8,"txt":"have a structured decision-making"},{"t":21.3,"txt":"process in place. By following the six"},{"t":23.5,"txt":"steps in today's workshop, you'll find"},{"t":25.6,"txt":"yourself able to make better choices,"},{"t":27.5,"txt":"avoid common pitfalls, and build [music]"},{"t":29.9,"txt":"confidence in the decisions you make."},{"t":31.8,"txt":"And if you stick around until the end,"},{"t":33.7,"txt":"I'll share how to overcome the dreaded"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"analysis paralysis. The first step to"},{"t":39.3,"txt":"improving your decision-m skills is"},{"t":41.2,"txt":"understanding the personality traits"},{"t":43,"txt":"that influence the choices we make. One"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"is overconfidence."},{"t":48.3,"txt":"While having confidence is great, too"},{"t":50.7,"txt":"much of it can lead to poor decisions. I"},{"t":53,"txt":"got it."},{"t":54.1,"txt":">> Are you sure?"},{"t":55.3,"txt":">> Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. I got it."},{"t":56.9,"txt":"I got it. I GOT IT."},{"t":59.7,"txt":"Knowing your limits is crucial to being"},{"t":61.3,"txt":"a good decision maker. Another important"},{"t":63.2,"txt":"trait that can influence our decisions"},{"t":64.9,"txt":"is risk tolerance. When faced with a"},{"t":67.4,"txt":"choice, do you tend to take a more"},{"t":69.1,"txt":"cautious approach or just jump right in?"},{"t":72.7,"txt":"Finally, our decisions are also"},{"t":74.9,"txt":"influenced by our natural biases."},{"t":77,"txt":"Everyone carries biases shaped by past"},{"t":79.4,"txt":"experiences, media, or fears. The key is"},{"t":82.8,"txt":"asking yourself, am I letting my bias"},{"t":85.2,"txt":"drive this decision? This will shift"},{"t":87.4,"txt":"your thinking, allowing you to take a"},{"t":89,"txt":"more analytical approach to vetting the"},{"t":91,"txt":"situation. Now that we know what could"},{"t":93,"txt":"be negatively influencing our decisions,"},{"t":95.3,"txt":"it's time to examine the right steps to"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"follow. Let's walk through the rest of"},{"t":99.1,"txt":"the steps that many good decision makers"},{"t":101.1,"txt":"use to choose wisely. Once you know a"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"decision must be made, gather what you"},{"t":106.3,"txt":"know and [music] what you need to know."},{"t":108.5,"txt":"That could be internal data, external"},{"t":110.5,"txt":"research, or insights from colleagues. A"},{"t":113,"txt":"SWAT diagram for strengths, weaknesses,"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"opportunities, and threats is one tool"},{"t":118.5,"txt":"that can help you weigh a decision."},{"t":120.2,"txt":"Let's say you're deciding whether to"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"take on a leadership role in a cross"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"department project. [music] Here's how a"},{"t":125.4,"txt":"SWAT diagram could help you break it"},{"t":127.1,"txt":"down."},{"t":128.8,"txt":"Strengths. you're already comfortable"},{"t":131.1,"txt":"presenting and you have good"},{"t":132.6,"txt":"relationships [music] across teams."},{"t":135.8,"txt":"Those are assets you bring into the"},{"t":137.7,"txt":"role."},{"t":139.3,"txt":"Weaknesses. [music] You've never managed"},{"t":141.4,"txt":"a budget before and this project comes"},{"t":143.4,"txt":"with financial responsibilities. That's"},{"t":145.8,"txt":"a potential skill gap to flag."},{"t":148.1,"txt":"Opportunities. If the project goes well,"},{"t":151,"txt":"you'll get visibility with senior"},{"t":152.6,"txt":"leadership and strengthen your chances"},{"t":154.5,"txt":"for promotion [music] threats. The"},{"t":158.5,"txt":"project has a tight timeline. If you"},{"t":161,"txt":"don't manage the workload, it can create"},{"t":163.3,"txt":"stress or affect your performance in"},{"t":165.1,"txt":"other areas. By laying these out side by"},{"t":167.8,"txt":"side, you can clearly see both the"},{"t":170.1,"txt":"upside and the risks, which will help"},{"t":172.3,"txt":"you make a more balanced choice about"},{"t":174.1,"txt":"whether the opportunity is the right one"},{"t":176,"txt":"to pursue. Next, examine the result of"},{"t":179.1,"txt":"all possible alternatives. [music]"},{"t":181,"txt":"Here's where the classic procon list"},{"t":183.5,"txt":"might come in, but for our purposes,"},{"t":185.9,"txt":"we'll be using [music] something a"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"little more advanced. Instead of making"},{"t":189.9,"txt":"a simple list of pros and cons behind"},{"t":192.3,"txt":"each decision, try building a decision"},{"t":196,"txt":"matrix."},{"t":197.7,"txt":"A decision matrix lets you score your"},{"t":199.6,"txt":"choices more precisely based on the"},{"t":201.3,"txt":"criteria [music] that matter most. Let's"},{"t":204.2,"txt":"look at an example by entering"},{"t":207.8,"txt":"the decision matrix."},{"t":210.5,"txt":"Imagine you've been offered two job"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"opportunities. Job A has higher pay, but"},{"t":216.3,"txt":"job B has better growth potential and"},{"t":218.5,"txt":"work life balance. To make the choice"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"more objective, build out a decision"},{"t":224,"txt":"[music] matrix. Here's how. Step one,"},{"t":227.7,"txt":"list your criteria for what you'd find"},{"t":229.4,"txt":"valuable in each, like salary,"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"advancement [music] opportunities,"},{"t":233.1,"txt":"commute distance, and flexibility. Step"},{"t":235.6,"txt":"two, decide how important each factor"},{"t":238.2,"txt":"is. For example, if growth is twice as"},{"t":241,"txt":"important to you as commute time, you"},{"t":243,"txt":"can weigh it higher. Step three, score"},{"t":245.9,"txt":"each job [music] against those factors."},{"t":248.1,"txt":"Salary for job A might get a nine, while"},{"t":250.6,"txt":"job B might score a six. Growth"},{"t":253.2,"txt":"opportunities, on [music] the other"},{"t":254.4,"txt":"hand, could be something different."},{"t":256.4,"txt":"Maybe here, job B gets a nine, and job A"},{"t":259.6,"txt":"gets the six. You get the idea. When you"},{"t":262.2,"txt":"multiply the scores [music] by the"},{"t":263.8,"txt":"waitings and add them up, you get a more"},{"t":266.2,"txt":"balanced picture of which role is the"},{"t":268.2,"txt":"better fit overall. The real value of a"},{"t":270.8,"txt":"decision matrix [music] is that it helps"},{"t":272.3,"txt":"you slow down and prioritize what's most"},{"t":274.8,"txt":"important to you, [music] so you don't"},{"t":276.6,"txt":"rely only on gut instinct. Whoa, I know"},{"t":280.9,"txt":"crochet."},{"t":283.9,"txt":"Looking for more career tips."},{"t":287.1,"txt":"The choice is clear. Just search Indeed"},{"t":290.2,"txt":"on YouTube for more videos just like"},{"t":292.1,"txt":"this. Now take each option before you"},{"t":294.8,"txt":"[music] and try to visualize the"},{"t":296.5,"txt":"results. Which options align [music]"},{"t":299.5,"txt":"with the company goals? Which solves the"},{"t":303,"txt":"problem most effectively? This [music]"},{"t":305.3,"txt":"step helps narrow your choices based on"},{"t":307.4,"txt":"the long-term impact you're looking for."},{"t":309.5,"txt":"Once you've weighed your options, the"},{"t":311.5,"txt":"next step is to choose the solution that"},{"t":313.4,"txt":"will bring the biggest [music] impact."},{"t":315.4,"txt":"One way to determine this is by running"},{"t":317.2,"txt":"what's called a paro [music] analysis."},{"t":320.6,"txt":"The paro analysis is based on the"},{"t":322.6,"txt":"principle that in many situations just a"},{"t":325.3,"txt":"small number of causes, roughly 20%,"},{"t":327.5,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":328.1,"txt":"are responsible for the majority of the"},{"t":330.2,"txt":"effect. The remaining 80%. Here's an"},{"t":333,"txt":"example. Imagine your customer support"},{"t":335.6,"txt":"team is struggling with complaints. When"},{"t":338.6,"txt":"you review the data, you discover that"},{"t":340.5,"txt":"out of 10 major issues, two long"},{"t":343.5,"txt":"response times and unclear billing"},{"t":345.6,"txt":"account for the 80% of all complaints. A"},{"t":349.5,"txt":"paro analysis shows you that instead of"},{"t":351.7,"txt":"trying to fix everything at once, you'll"},{"t":354.2,"txt":"make the biggest impact [music] by"},{"t":355.8,"txt":"improving response times and clarifying"},{"t":358.2,"txt":"invoices. By tackling those two areas"},{"t":360.6,"txt":"first, you resolve the majority of"},{"t":362.6,"txt":"customer [music] frustration. That's the"},{"t":364.8,"txt":"power of Paro."},{"t":367.3,"txt":"It directs your energy towards the"},{"t":369,"txt":"changes that will matter most. And"},{"t":372,"txt":"finally, even the best decisions need"},{"t":374.8,"txt":"follow-up. Watch how your choice plays"},{"t":377.1,"txt":"out, track results, and pay attention"},{"t":379.2,"txt":"[music] to feedback. If circumstances"},{"t":381.7,"txt":"change, you may need to tweak or pivot,"},{"t":384.6,"txt":"but that's okay."},{"t":388.1,"txt":"It's all part of the decision-m [music]"},{"t":389.7,"txt":"process."},{"t":392.1,"txt":"Taking these strategic steps can help"},{"t":394,"txt":"you make better decisions faster. But"},{"t":396.8,"txt":"that does leave one big analytical"},{"t":398.9,"txt":"elephant in the room. Analysis"},{"t":402.2,"txt":"paralysis."},{"t":404.5,"txt":"We've all been there. It's that feeling"},{"t":406.3,"txt":"when you're suddenly getting overwhelmed"},{"t":407.9,"txt":"by information and options that you"},{"t":409.3,"txt":"can't make any decision at all. And it's"},{"t":410.7,"txt":"one of the biggest barriers to sound"},{"t":412.3,"txt":"decision-m."},{"t":415.7,"txt":"The best way to break through analysis"},{"t":417.3,"txt":"paralysis is by taking action right"},{"t":419.9,"txt":"away. Screenshot this cheat sheet of all"},{"t":422.9,"txt":"the steps [music] you can take. One, set"},{"t":425,"txt":"a deadline for making the decision. Two,"},{"t":428,"txt":"limit your options to two or [music]"},{"t":429.8,"txt":"three strongest choices. Three, use a"},{"t":433.5,"txt":"simple framework [music] like the"},{"t":435.1,"txt":"decision matrix. And finally, four, ask"},{"t":439.2,"txt":"for input from a trusted colleague."},{"t":441.2,"txt":"Remember that no decision is permanent."},{"t":443.4,"txt":"[music] Take some pressure off yourself"},{"t":445.1,"txt":"and remember that you can always adjust"},{"t":446.9,"txt":"if needed. Strong decision-m isn't about"},{"t":449.8,"txt":"always being right [music] or chasing"},{"t":451.4,"txt":"perfection. It's about using tools,"},{"t":454.1,"txt":"self-awareness, and structure to make"},{"t":456.4,"txt":"thoughtful choices and then learning"},{"t":457.9,"txt":"[music] from the outcomes. If you found"},{"t":459.9,"txt":"this workshop helpful, don't forget to"},{"t":461.8,"txt":"like and subscribe and check out Indeed"},{"t":464.1,"txt":"on YouTube for more resources on"},{"t":465.9,"txt":"improving your career skills."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Should"},{"t":0.4,"w":"you"},{"t":0.56,"w":"watch"},{"t":0.8,"w":"this"},{"t":1.12,"w":"video?"},{"t":2.24,"w":"Of"},{"t":2.56,"w":"course."},{"t":3.84,"w":"If"},{"t":4,"w":"only"},{"t":4.24,"w":"making"},{"t":4.56,"w":"all"},{"t":4.799,"w":"decisions"},{"t":5.2,"w":"were"},{"t":5.359,"w":"that"},{"t":5.6,"w":"easy."},{"t":6.319,"w":"Decision-"},{"t":6.799,"w":"making"},{"t":7.04,"w":"is"},{"t":7.2,"w":"a"},{"t":7.44,"w":"skill"},{"t":7.6,"w":"that"},{"t":7.839,"w":"impacts"},{"t":8.32,"w":"nearly"},{"t":8.8,"w":"every"},{"t":9.2,"w":"aspect"},{"t":9.679,"w":"of"},{"t":9.92,"w":"work"},{"t":10.16,"w